                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac50db3a-c1a8-436f-818f-00cbca68b331",
                                "sense_id": "4b822ff0-0384-397b-a1f5-6585d148201e",
                                "text": "Людски́е голоса́ звуча́ли ре́дко и сде́ржанно: ото всего́ ве́яло у́тром, тишино́й и спо́ростью у́тренней рабо́ты, ве́яло поря́дком и пра́вильностью устано́вленной жи́зни.",
                                "translation": "The men's voices were heard seldom, and in reserved fashion: about everything there was a feeling of morning, of the peace and rapid progress of morning work, a feeling of order and regularity of life.",
                                "english": "The men's voices were heard seldom, and in reserved fashion: about everything there was a feeling of morning, of the peace and rapid progress of morning work, a feeling of order and regularity of life."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
